<title>FINLAND: FINNISH Q3 GDP UP 3.8 PCT YR/YR, UP 2.1 PCT ON Q2.</title>
<headline>FINNISH Q3 GDP UP 3.8 PCT YR/YR, UP 2.1 PCT ON Q2.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's gross domestic</p>
<p>product (GDP) at market prices rose 3.8 percent year-on-year in</p>
<p>the third quarter of 1996, Statistics Finland (SF) said on</p>
<p>Monday in a statement.</p>
<p>Adjusted for seasonal factors, Q3 GDP grew 2.1 percent on</p>
<p>Q2, SF said.</p>
<p>			  Q3 '96	Q2 '96	Q3 '95</p>
<p>Quarter/Quarter     +2.1	  +0.3	  +0.2</p>
<p>Year/Year	     +3.8	  +1.6	  +2.7</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
